WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:07.658
Aunt Judy spent all day in the kitchen.

2
00:00:07.659 --> 00:00:18.742
She made a special cake.

3
00:00:18.743 --> 00:00:27.210
The cake had raisins, carrots, and cherries.

4
00:00:27.211 --> 00:00:34.326
"I hope everyone likes my cake," said Aunt Judy.

5
00:00:34.327 --> 00:00:36.833
She gave a piece to Emmy.

6
00:00:36.834 --> 00:00:38.947
"Oh," said Emmy.

7
00:00:38.948 --> 00:00:42.792
"I don't like raisins."

8
00:00:42.793 --> 00:00:48.382
Emmy picked out the raisins.

9
00:00:48.383 --> 00:00:53.834
Aunt Judy cut a piece of cake for Dad.

10
00:00:53.835 --> 00:00:57.995
"I never eat carrots," said Dad.

11
00:00:57.996 --> 00:01:02.551
He ate everything but the carrots.

12
00:01:02.552 --> 00:01:06.851
Aunt Judy handed a piece to Harry.

13
00:01:06.852 --> 00:01:11.269
"Yuck!" said Harry. "Cherries."

14
00:01:11.270 --> 00:01:19.493
He left all of the cherries on his plate.

15
00:01:19.494 --> 00:01:23.040
Aunt Judy gave a piece to Mom.

16
00:01:23.041 --> 00:01:25.879
"Thank you," said Mom.

17
00:01:25.880 --> 00:01:30.783
"I will just eat the things that I like."

18
00:01:30.784 --> 00:01:36.979
Mom picked out the raisins, carrots, and cherries.

19
00:01:36.980 --> 00:01:40.666
She ate them all.

20
00:01:40.667 --> 00:01:43.882
Her cake now had little holes in it.

21
00:01:43.883 --> 00:01:49.258
Oliver ate his whole piece of cake.

22
00:01:49.259 --> 00:01:52.832
"I love this cake!" said Oliver.

23
00:01:52.833 --> 00:01:55.915
"I love everything in it!"

24
00:01:55.916 --> 00:01:58.595
Oliver wished he had more cake.

25
00:01:58.596 --> 00:02:05.420
He looked at everyone's plate.

26
00:02:05.421 --> 00:02:08.668
He had an idea.

27
00:02:08.669 --> 00:02:11.625
Oliver took Mom's cake.

28
00:02:11.626 --> 00:02:15.024
He went around to everyone's plate.

29
00:02:15.025 --> 00:02:26.954
He collected the raisins, carrots, and cherries.

30
00:02:26.955 --> 00:02:29.585
Oliver held up his plate.

31
00:02:29.586 --> 00:02:38.330
"I have a new piece of cake!" said Oliver.

